        <text x='97' y='93' fill='#666D80' fontSize='11' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>结论 + 证据候选</text>
        <rect x='190' y='48' width='158' height='58' rx='9' fill='#161A24' stroke='#22D3EE' strokeWidth='1.5' />
        <text x='269' y='74' fill='#EEF1F6' fontSize='13' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>时序核查智能体</text>
        <text x='269' y='93' fill='#666D80' fontSize='11' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>时间线一致性</text>
        <rect x='362' y='48' width='158' height='58' rx='9' fill='#161A24' stroke='#22D3EE' strokeWidth='1.5' />
        <text x='441' y='74' fill='#EEF1F6' fontSize='13' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>立场研判智能体</text>
        <text x='441' y='93' fill='#666D80' fontSize='11' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>口径与倾向识别</text>
        <rect x='534' y='48' width='168' height='58' rx='9' fill='#161A24' stroke='#22D3EE' strokeWidth='1.5' />
        <text x='618' y='74' fill='#EEF1F6' fontSize='13' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>反证检索智能体</text>
        <text x='618' y='93' fill='#666D80' fontSize='11' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>主动寻找反例</text>

        <path d='M360 124 L360 156' stroke='#2C3346' strokeWidth='2' />
        <path d='M354 148 L360 158 L366 148 Z' fill='#2C3346' />

        <rect x='0' y='160' width='720' height='118' rx='14' fill='#12161F' stroke='#60A5FA' strokeWidth='1.5' strokeDasharray='6 4' opacity='0.55' />
        <text x='18' y='188' fill='#60A5FA' fontSize='15' fontWeight='bold' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>L1 · 仲裁与消解层（冲突识别 → 博弈对抗 → 证据加权）</text>
        <rect x='18' y='202' width='158' height='58' rx='9' fill='#161A24' stroke='#60A5FA' strokeWidth='1.5' />
        <text x='97' y='228' fill='#EEF1F6' fontSize='13' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>冲突识别</text>
        <text x='97' y='247' fill='#666D80' fontSize='11' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>事实 / 口径 / 立场</text>
        <rect x='190' y='202' width='158' height='58' rx='9' fill='#161A24' stroke='#FBBF24' strokeWidth='1.5' />
        <text x='269' y='228' fill='#EEF1F6' fontSize='13' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>博弈对抗</text>
        <text x='269' y='247' fill='#666D80' fontSize='11' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>正方 / 反方 / 仲裁</text>
        <rect x='362' y='202' width='158' height='58' rx='9' fill='#161A24' stroke='#FBBF24' strokeWidth='1.5' />
        <text x='441' y='228' fill='#EEF1F6' fontSize='13' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>证据加权消解</text>
        <text x='441' y='247' fill='#666D80' fontSize='11' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>按可信度重算</text>
        <rect x='534' y='202' width='168' height='58' rx='9' fill='#161A24' stroke='#A78BFA' strokeWidth='1.5' />
        <text x='618' y='228' fill='#EEF1F6' fontSize='13' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>分歧留档</text>
        <text x='618' y='247' fill='#666D80' fontSize='11' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>少数意见不覆盖</text>

        <path d='M360 278 L360 310' stroke='#2C3346' strokeWidth='2' />
        <path d='M354 302 L360 312 L366 302 Z' fill='#2C3346' />

        <rect x='0' y='314' width='720' height='118' rx='14' fill='#12161F' stroke='#34D399' strokeWidth='1.5' strokeDasharray='6 4' opacity='0.55' />
        <text x='18' y='342' fill='#34D399' fontSize='15' fontWeight='bold' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>L2 · 审计与追溯层（可查、可复现、可干预）</text>
        <rect x='18' y='356' width='158' height='58' rx='9' fill='#161A24' stroke='#34D399' strokeWidth='1.5' />
        <text x='97' y='382' fill='#EEF1F6' fontSize='13' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>证据图谱</text>
        <text x='97' y='401' fill='#666D80' fontSize='11' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>结论→证据→来源</text>
        <rect x='190' y='356' width='158' height='58' rx='9' fill='#161A24' stroke='#34D399' strokeWidth='1.5' />
        <text x='269' y='382' fill='#EEF1F6' fontSize='13' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>推理树</text>
        <text x='269' y='401' fill='#666D80' fontSize='11' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>中间结论留痕</text>
        <rect x='362' y='356' width='158' height='58' rx='9' fill='#161A24' stroke='#34D399' strokeWidth='1.5' />
        <text x='441' y='382' fill='#EEF1F6' fontSize='13' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>防篡改哈希链</text>
        <text x='441' y='401' fill='#666D80' fontSize='11' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>审计留痕</text>
        <rect x='534' y='356' width='168' height='58' rx='9' fill='#161A24' stroke='#34D399' strokeWidth='1.5' />
        <text x='618' y='382' fill='#EEF1F6' fontSize='13' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>人工复核闸</text>
        <text x='618' y='401' fill='#666D80' fontSize='11' textAnchor='middle' fontFamily='Microsoft YaHei'>可干预后重算</text>
      </svg>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ width: 380, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#666D80', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 2 }}>认知支柱</Text>

      <Box style={{ background: '#161A24', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #232838', borderLeft: '3px solid #22D3EE', padding: 18 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#EEF1F6' }}>K-M-D 认知决策管道</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#A4ABBD', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8 }}>
          知识层给出判据，方法层给出算法，决策层输出结论。每层都留痕，结论可逐层回溯。
        </Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ background: '#161A24', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #232838', borderLeft: '3px solid #FBBF24', padding: 18 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#EEF1F6' }}>三维置信度</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#A4ABBD', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8 }}>
          信源可信度 × 证据强度 × 逻辑一致性，输出可复算的评分与扣分理由，而非一个孤立的百分比。
        </Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ background: '#161A24', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #232838', borderLeft: '3px solid #34D399', padding: 18 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#EEF1F6' }}>决策第 0 闸</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#A4ABBD', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 8 }}>
          缺什么信息就报什么，不放行、不静默通过；处置类结论一律转人工复核，不自动执行。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #232838' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#666D80' }}>ChiYu AI · 多智能体可信研判与证据链溯源系统</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#666D80' }}>06 / 14</Text>
  </Box>

</Slide>
